FAQ

How do I play?
Tap to jump, dodge obstacles, and survive as long as you can.

What are the power-ups?
Double jump, slow time, and shield help you survive longer and get a better score.

How do I get a better score?
Stay alive longer, collect power-ups, and avoid obstacles.

The game crashes or won’t load.
Try updating iOS, restarting your device, or reinstalling the app. If the issue continues, email us with your device model and iOS version.

How do I report a bug or request a feature?
Email ensarigizem1230@gmail.com with details and a screenshot if possible.

Is Neon Leap free?
Yes, Neon Leap is free to play.

What devices are supported?
Neon Leap runs on iPhone and iPad with a recent version of iOS.

